<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/38/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Arbitration Act 2005 [Act 646], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2, by inserting after the definition of “party” the following definition: ‘ “President” means the President of the Asian International Arbitration Centre Court of Arbitration;’. Amendment of section 3"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/38/eng@> .
